# ---- Working notes, not code ----
# PROGRESS/TASKS/RESUME are the agent work-state files and README/docs are documentation. They are
# kept locally and deliberately untracked so this repository holds only the code that ships: a diff
# then never mixes a behaviour change with a note about it, and reverting code cannot lose the notes.
/README.md
/PROGRESS.md
/TASKS.md
/RESUME.md
/docs/

# ---- Historical source snapshot duplicated under artifacts/ ----
# artifacts/baseline-<date>/ is a full copy of the tree taken by an earlier session.
# Git history is now the source of truth for old code, so the copy is not versioned.
artifacts/baseline-*/
